<item>
<title>微信、淘宝、美团等151款APP拒绝豆包手机助手GUI自动化代操作；对标字节红果，腾讯上线绿泡泡短剧；OpenAI 一工程师被捕，涉嫌窃听机密</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/zaobao/VMod1gHtw3lRoiXd.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>要闻提示</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mv8cwnhcof4" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;">1.上演“窃听风云”？OpenAI 一工程师被捕，高管会议室惊现窃听器</section><section style="text-align: justify;">2.微信、淘宝、DeepSeek等在列，151款应用拒绝豆包手机助手GUI自动化代操作<br/></section><section style="text-align: justify;">3.对标字节红果，腾讯低调上线绿泡泡短剧</section><section style="text-align: justify;">4.小鹏正式宣布：开始对外卖技术</section><section style="text-align: justify;">5.“红果短剧降智”冲上热搜，医生回应</section><section style="text-align: justify;">6.iPhoneDuo完成大模型备案，涉及Apple智能、通义万象、通义千问</section><section style="text-align: justify;">7.被字节开除，田柯宇否认“模型投毒”，称是“以暴制暴”</section><p style="text-align: justify;">8.宝马：2030 年在华销售的车辆中，超 95% 将实现本土生产</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>今日头条</strong></span></p></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mmxst4fs1xis" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam1od114ht" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>上演“窃听风云”？OpenAI 一工程师被捕，高管会议室惊现窃听器</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，在OpenAI担任工程师的沙特籍男子Abdulrahman Alfozan，因涉嫌在该公司旧金山办公室内藏匿一台加密录音设备而被捕，并受到刑事指控。事发后，OpenAI已解雇Alfozan。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">美国联邦检察官周二指控称，今年9月下旬，Alfozan将一个黑色小型录音设备裹在厕纸里，随后将其插在OpenAI一间会议室电视机背面的USB接口上，而这间会议室正是高管们进行高度机密的技术、战略及商业磋商的场所。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">近两周前，OpenAI在例行安全排查中发现该设备并报案，但未打草惊蛇，而是悄悄在会议室加装了摄像头。10月5日，Alfozan潜入该会议室后，被新装的摄像头拍得一清二楚。OpenAI表示，该小型设备在被发现前，已放置了约两天时间。目前没有迹象表明他曾接触过驱动公司AI工具的模型权重。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">据悉，Alfozan在OpenAI产品团队工作一年多，目前被控使用或试图使用设备截取口头通信内容，已于上周被捕。如果罪名成立，最高可能面临五年监禁。（科创板日报、AI普瑞斯）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7cbfe8d4-fb78-42cd-b6e2-edd8b2e2538f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:387.90000000000003,&quot;width&quot;:486,&quot;currHeight&quot;:387.90000000000003,&quot;currWidth&quot;:486,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:862,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.45,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAim7bQistoCio7xorXecPwEinrE%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Aim7bQistoCio7xorXecPwEinrE&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:600674,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295adf497.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7981481481481482" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="862" data-backw="578" data-backh="461" data-imgfileid="504274434" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295adf497.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8cz4zsa4m" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国内资讯</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>微信、淘宝、DeepSeek等在列，151款应用拒绝豆包手机助手GUI自动化代操作</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，豆包手机助手官方发布的内容显示，《屏幕自动化操作声明协议》（SAEP）30天公示期结束后，将逐步开放第三方应用的GUI自动化操作能力，开放范围限于未声明拒绝的应用。公示期结束后，开发者仍可声明拒绝。对于声明拒绝的应用，豆包手机助手不会进行相关操作。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">豆包同步对外披露了一份拒绝操作清单，共计151款应用不允许豆包手机助手对其执行GUI屏幕自动化操作，微信、DeepSeek、淘宝、快手、美团等大众高频应用尽数在列。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">需要说明的是，所谓拒绝接入，并非代表这些应用不能在“豆包手机”努比亚M153、努比亚NaviX Ultra手机上安装、登录，用户依旧可以手动打开使用。开发者拒绝的，是豆包手机助手通过GUI图形界面识别、模拟点击滑动的自动化代操作能力。（济南日报）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dc1b10c3-4228-4470-a137-7c370c184bdd&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:277.7185185185185,&quot;width&quot;:364,&quot;currHeight&quot;:277.7185185185185,&quot;currWidth&quot;:364,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:824,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.337037037037037,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FS7D9bU65Ios9LFxZgHocdzwznzd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;S7D9bU65Ios9LFxZgHocdzwznzd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:171736,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295b3a1cc.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.762962962962963" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="824" data-backw="578" data-backh="441" data-imgfileid="504274436" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295b3a1cc.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;">部分拒绝操作应用清单</section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8dbbymfn8"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>对标字节红果，腾讯低调上线绿泡泡短剧</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，据媒体报道，近日，腾讯低调上线了“绿泡泡短剧”，主打“免费好剧，一点就看”。另有报道称，腾讯合作方近期正在申请绿泡泡短剧商标。对此，有网友调侃：“小时候看红果果绿泡泡，长大了还是红果果绿泡泡。”</p><p style="text-align: justify;">媒体打开绿泡泡短剧小程序了解到，该产品由微信短剧内容中心推出，产品标识为微信品牌绿。用户无需下载独立App，在小程序内即可观看。区别于传统短视频平台的算法推荐逻辑，“绿泡泡短剧”最突出的特征是强社交属性，首页专门设置了“朋友在看”推荐位。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">报道称，腾讯此时入局免费短剧，直接对标的正是字节跳动旗下红果短剧。此前，红果短剧凭借免费广告模式快速起量，数据显示，截至2026年7月，红果短剧独立App日活跃用户达1.68亿，同比增长107%，已超过腾讯视频、爱奇艺、优酷、芒果TV四家长视频平台日活之和。（界面新闻、每日经济新闻）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1affe877-6153-4573-a49f-5dc7b3af26f5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:295.1546707503828,&quot;width&quot;:317,&quot;currHeight&quot;:295.1546707503828,&quot;currWidth&quot;:317,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:608,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:653,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.48545176110260335,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPnbmbi6SioUFA3x9qMfcwlU3noc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Pnbmbi6SioUFA3x9qMfcwlU3noc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:483325,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295b82675.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9310872894333844" data-type="png" data-w="653" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="653" data-height="608" data-backw="578" data-backh="538" data-imgfileid="504274435" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295b82675.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8dd3ng14dy" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>小鹏正式宣布：开始对外卖技术</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日，据媒体报道，2026巴黎车展期间，小鹏集团董事长何小鹏宣布，公司将面向全球开放智能汽车技术合作，涵盖整车平台、模块化技术与全套工具链三大核心板块。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">其中整车平台包含整车平台架构、电子电气架构；模块化技术覆盖智驾、AI BOX、芯片、电池、电驱；配套工具链包含远程XCP标定、整车EOL、AI 诊断等。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>除智能汽车板块之外，小鹏还将同步开放物理 AI 生态全域解决方案业务，包括人形机器人、Robotaxi、飞行汽车、图灵 AI 芯片、物理世界基座模型等板块，提供全域商业化解决方案。何小鹏表示：“小鹏的Robotaxi业务正在与欧洲多家头部出行平台展开深度洽谈，相关合作进展预计不久后对外公开。”（第一财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>“红果短剧降智”冲上热搜，医生回应</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，近日，话题#红果短剧降智#冲上热搜。不少网友发帖称，刷完平台高密度反转的爽感短剧，感觉脑子变迟钝，甚至一刷就停不下来。多位网友晒出近期手机屏幕使用时长，显示其红果短剧的日均使用时长超10小时。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">浙江中医药大学附属第二医院临床心理科副主任邹莹表示，短剧密集的反转钩子持续刺激多巴胺，让大脑被动兴奋、超负荷运转。长期高频消耗这类神经递质后，再处理日常事务就容易疲惫，并非真的智商下降，而是多巴胺储备透支，导致专注与理解能力暂时变差，产生 “变笨” 的感受。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">据第三方数据机构统计，2026年8月，在中国月度使用时长排名前50的应用中，字节系产品总时长份额达到41.8%。其中，红果短剧约125分钟/天，抖音约112-120分钟/天。此事引发网友热议。有网友认为看短剧会降低专注力与耐心，不少剧情套路化、逻辑经不起推敲。但也有网友表示，看短剧属于个人消遣选择，如今不少AI短剧制作水准已经较为精良，没必要捧一踩一。（21财经、第一财经）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fc920368-991b-477d-9aa2-29f9bce1525b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:245.00576701268741,&quot;width&quot;:430,&quot;currHeight&quot;:245.00576701268741,&quot;currWidth&quot;:430,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:494,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:867,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.49596309111880044,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FC27Sb9Gp9oTe1hxa8gHc1yvkndf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;C27Sb9Gp9oTe1hxa8gHc1yvkndf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:153681,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295ba4231.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5697808535178778" data-type="jpeg" data-w="867" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="867" data-height="494" data-backw="578" data-backh="329" data-imgfileid="504274437" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295ba4231.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8ddpbbwro" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>iPhoneDuo完成大模型备案，涉及Apple智能、通义万象、通义千问</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，工信部电信设备进网许可信息显示，苹果iPhone Duo折叠屏手机国行版（型号A3721）在今年9月2日获得试用批文许可证后，于9月29日完成换证，新增了所搭载大模型的备案编号。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>该设备搭载的大模型备案编号为：Shanghai-AppleZhiNeng-202506160057、Shanghai-TongYiWanXiang-202410090024、ZheJiang-TongYiQianWen-20230901，分别对应Apple智能、通义万象、通义千问。（济南日报）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>被字节开除，田柯宇否认“模型投毒”，称是“以暴制暴”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，近日，“田柯宇创业”冲上热搜。据悉，被字节跳动开除后，田柯宇创办了自己的人工智能实验室，主攻方向是世界模型，目前已完成近3000万美元融资，投资方包含五源资本与IDG资本，项目投后估值达到2亿美元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">田柯宇在2024年因攻击大模型训练事件被字节开除，近日他在一期播客节目中回应了相关传闻。田柯宇称自己是因为看不惯一名新来的实习生随意停掉其他人的程序，组内领导也不干涉，他便选择“以暴制暴”，用GPT写程序停掉该实习生的任务。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">播客上线后，其前团队同事发布了一份上万字说明报告，指出田柯宇的说法与事实存在出入，并提醒其合作者与投资人审慎核实。目前田柯宇方面尚未对该报告做出回应。（红星资本局）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7f455939-0308-4595-a769-ea5d1c58c5ac&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:245.10370370370373,&quot;width&quot;:326,&quot;currHeight&quot;:245.10370370370373,&quot;currWidth&quot;:326,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:812,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.30185185185185187,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQmwIbOV69ow7MHxJlpccWiabnVb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QmwIbOV69ow7MHxJlpccWiabnVb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:286354,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295bcd17e.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7518518518518519" data-type="webp" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="812" data-backw="578" data-backh="435" data-imgfileid="504274438" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295bcd17e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8deo2j1q9j" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>威马汽车公众号发文讨薪：B能汽车，请发我们工资</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日，威马汽车公众号突然更新，发布题为“第一天：B能汽车，请发我们工资”的文章。但该文章发布后不久即被删除。与此同时，威马汽车官方App“小威随行”在苹果App Store已无法搜索到，从今年6月底开始大量车主反映App无法登录使用。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据媒体报道，宝能汽车客服人员就此事回应称，威马目前由深圳翔飞汽车销售有限公司接手，在媒体追问翔飞是否与宝能有关联时，该客服给出了肯定答复，并称威马车辆有问题也可以联系他们。对于威马公众号发布的讨薪内容，宝能汽车客服人员将其归结为历史遗留问题，表示“是威马以前欠的”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">公开资料显示，威马汽车成立于2015年，曾与蔚来、小鹏、理想并称为造车新势力“四小龙”，累计融资超410亿元。2021年起公司陷入持续亏损，随后2023年工厂全面停摆，欠薪、供应商欠款问题集中爆发。2024年3月，法院确认其资不抵债，正式进入实质合并重整程序。重整案提及的审计报告显示，威马科技集团负债高达203.67亿元。（鞭牛士、财闻）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f7d7ec7d-6110-412b-b8f1-725692138a55&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:308.1555555555555,&quot;width&quot;:294,&quot;currHeight&quot;:308.1555555555555,&quot;currWidth&quot;:294,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1132,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.2722222222222222,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSlMubNpUUo3ni2xeHapc8PASnWe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;SlMubNpUUo3ni2xeHapc8PASnWe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:409338,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c05594.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.048148148148148" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="1132" data-backw="578" data-backh="606" data-imgfileid="504274439" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c05594.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8df528mfp" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>阶跃终端发布首款智能体手机STEPX Neo，售价3999元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日，STEPX（阶跃终端）在上海发布其首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo先行版。该手机搭载了智能体原生操作系统Step AOS 1.0（Step Agentic-native OS）与新一代个人智能体阶跃Amoo。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据介绍，STEPX Neo先行版售价3999元，采用软硬件和模型一体化定价，包含手机、Step AOS、Step系列模型及Step Studio。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>阶跃星辰董事长印奇在发布会上介绍了公司对AI手机形态的设想：用户以任务为中心与智能体交互，系统调用模型和服务完成任务，开发者也可以根据个人需求创建应用。另据报道，媒体从供应链人士处获悉，该机屏幕供应商为TCL华星。（财闻、蓝鲸新闻）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>贾跃亭宣布 FFR 合并 FFAI 机器人业务独立上市，目标美股人形和仿生机器人第一股</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，贾跃亭发微博宣布，FFAI与FF EAI Robotics Ecosystem Inc.（纳斯达克代码FFR）于10月12日正式签署最终协议，FFR将以全股票方式收购FFAI的机器人业务并独立上市，预计本月底前完成所有交割。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">这笔交易约定FFAI机器人业务估值约2亿美元，而FFR交割前按充分稀释口径计算的股权价值仅约6000万美元。FFR将以每股2.246美元的价格向FFAI溢价发行股份，较签约日1.5美元的收盘价溢价约50%，较10月12日1.45美元的收盘价溢价55%。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">贾跃亭表示，FFR 将成为美股“四核全智”人形和仿生 EAI 机器人生态 Pure-Play 第一股，目标五年内保持 EAI 机器人行业综合排名前三，让公司成为 Physical AI 时代下最具价值的 EAI 公司之一。（快科技、IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a5a7b158-8beb-487a-b4db-28029480a3ec&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:371.25,&quot;width&quot;:270,&quot;currHeight&quot;:371.25,&quot;currWidth&quot;:270,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:825,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.45,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYmhDbNf53oI9SMxSBffcsOLzngc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YmhDbNf53oI9SMxSBffcsOLzngc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:485835,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c4bb8c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.375" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 305px;height: 419px;" data-width="600" data-height="825" data-imgfileid="504274440" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c4bb8c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8dfrpd1tb7" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>阿里千问办公发布电商版，开启邀测</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，千问办公发布电商版。基于电商行业商家的日常工作场景进行了AI能力的重新设计和增强，尤其是针对跨多平台的电商经营场景，用一个AI入口驱动不同的电商平台，帮助商家完成AI时代的运营升级。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>千问办公电商版已开启邀测，在千问办公中切换至“电商经营”模式即可体验。据介绍，除了生成营销素材、数据分析等通用 AI 功能外，千问办公电商版还推出四大专业功能，帮助商家用 AI 管理跨平台、多店铺、全流程的生意。（三言科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>偷拍内容发境外群！《原神》4.4测试泄密案终审落定：判赔50万</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 14 日消息，米哈游法务部发文披露，《原神》线下测试人员泄密至境外终被追责，被判赔偿 50 万元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">近日，《原神》线下测试泄密未公开角色、活动信息商业秘密侵权案件迎来终审结果。法院二审驳回上诉，维持一审判决，认定测试人员金某侵犯商业秘密，判令其停止侵权并赔偿米哈游经济损失及合理开支共计 50 万元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前米哈游法务巡查发现，网络上出现了涉及《原神》4.4 版本多个未公开角色、道具、活动信息的相关图片，图片的标注为 Telegram 电报群“Chalice_Leaks”（现已关停）。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>经调查，系游戏测试人员金某违反保密协议，在测试期间仍擅自使用手机拍摄游戏未公开内容，并将相关偷拍照片发送至“Oaemin”等人。而“Oaemin”作为境外 TG 频道的管理人员，将上述未公开内容在频道内发出，致使上述内容在全网大范围传播。（IT之家）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>遭多个指数剔除！茶百道深夜回应涉IPO欺诈</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日晚间，茶百道发布公告称，本公司董事会注意到，香港证监会已于10月13日上午九时正起暂停本公司H股买卖。香港证监会表示，其关注本公司的首次公开发售可能曾被人为操纵，以营造对股份需求的假象。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">本公司董事会高度重视此事，并坚信遵守所有适用于本公司的法律及法规至关重要。因此，本公司正就该指令紧急寻求法律意见，并将努力处理及解决香港证监会关注的事项。本公司承诺全力配合香港证监会处理其任何关注事项，并将适时另行刊发公告。本公司确认，本集团的业务营运维持正常，且截至本公告日期，本集团的业务营运并无发生重大变动。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>同日晚间，恒生指数公司发布公告称，茶百道于香港联合交易所上市之股份受监管机构调查而停牌，其公司股份将会从恒生指数系列中剔除。茶百道将于2026年10月22日（星期四）开市前调整为系统最低价格（即0.0001港元）并用作当天指数计算，并于当天收市后以0.0001港元从下列指数中剔除，下述变动将于2026年10月23日（星期五）起生效。（第一财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>苹果库克现身爱奇艺总部，爱奇艺 CEO 龚宇亲自接待</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 14 日，据多位博主/网友分享，苹果前首席执行官、现苹果公司董事会执行主席蒂姆 · 库克到访了爱奇艺总部，爱奇艺 CEO 龚宇亲自进行接待。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">从一博主分享的现场照来看，爱奇艺方面准备有其适配苹果设备的历史进程图，可以直观看到爱奇艺适配不同苹果设备的具体型号和年份。该博主还透露，自己去爱奇艺是看 iPhone Duo 的适配成果，预计库克也会在现场观看相关内容。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前报道，蒂姆·库克本月再度开启了中国之行。根据他微博的分享内容来看，他首站落地广州。13日，多位网友晒图，称在清华大学经济管理学院看到了蒂姆 · 库克。还有网友透露，清华大学当日举办了清华大学经济管理学院顾问委员会 2026 年会议。（IT之家)</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dd861724-31b5-4de0-8036-a77ffd0e931a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:241,&quot;width&quot;:497,&quot;currHeight&quot;:241,&quot;currWidth&quot;:497,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:241,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:497,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIK56bFs1GolJVaxyxcUcozjMnub%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IK56bFs1GolJVaxyxcUcozjMnub&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:95838,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c7496d.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.48490945674044267" data-type="png" data-w="497" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="497" data-height="241" data-backw="497" data-backh="241" data-imgfileid="504274441" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295c7496d.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8dgu9esoy" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>霸王茶姬向部分用户补发“全品类买一送一券”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日，有多名网友反映，收到了霸王茶姬就庆祝郑钦文夺冠优惠活动异常订单的补偿消息，凡是在活动中有订单未正常完成的顾客，系统自动发放一张全品类买一送一券。线上客服称，若部分订单未被系统识别并纳入名单，可填写登记表，确认符合条件后，约7个工作日内补发补偿券。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">另据日前报道，针对本次活动期间门店伙伴的高强度付出，霸王茶姬已向全国门店发布内部感谢信，同时宣布将发放总计1350万元的专项奖励：其中350万元作为“伙伴团建费”，1000万元作为“伙伴激励专项红包”。并表示，所有奖励将尽快落实到每一位参与本次活动保障的门店员工手中。（九派新闻、第一财经）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4b08793c-8c15-4a68-a3ab-277650ccb148&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:242.35349940688022,&quot;width&quot;:452.00000000000006,&quot;currHeight&quot;:242.35349940688022,&quot;currWidth&quot;:452.00000000000006,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:452,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:843,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5361803084223014,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAzilbdnDio0nJUxq76Ac0G64nBg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AzilbdnDio0nJUxq76Ac0G64nBg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:874617,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295cbb90e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5361803084223014" data-type="png" data-w="843" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="843" data-height="452" data-backw="578" data-backh="310" data-imgfileid="504274442" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295cbb90e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam15q08cj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国际资讯</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>宝马：2030 年在华销售的车辆中，超 95% 将实现本土生产</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 14 日消息，据媒体报道，10 月 13 日，宝马集团董事长聂科维就任后首次访华。聂科维指出，中国已经成为全球最具挑战性的标杆市场之一。宝马在华持续深入推进“本土化”以成就“全球化”发展，这也是集团的重要战略方向。宝马还计划，到 2030 年对华销售的汽车中，超过 95% 实现本土生产。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>结束在北京的行程后，聂科维还将前往辽宁沈阳，并于 15 日出席 2026 宝马中国创新日暨第六代动力电池下线仪式。据悉，沈阳是宝马全球生产网络的重要基地，第六代动力电池项目由宝马投资 100 亿元人民币建设，其正式量产是集团在华本土化和电动化进程中的又一个里程碑。（IT之家）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>OpenAI洽谈收购开源安全厂商Trail of Bits，加码网络安全业务</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，据知情人士透露，OpenAI正就收购网络安全初创公司Trail of Bits进行初步谈判，交易落地后将补强其网络安全业务布局。目前交易金额尚未披露，谈判仍在推进，存在流产可能性。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>Trail of Bits成立于2012年，主营开源软件漏洞挖掘与修复，团队40余人，以安全工程师为主。今年6月，该公司就曾与OpenAI合作发起“Patch the Planet”项目，依托OpenAI Codex系列AI模型，针对Python等热门开源项目查找、修复代码漏洞。（新浪财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>微软Azure被传要求部门削减20%成本，云业务同时推进管理层重组</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日消息，据知情人士透露，微软正讨论在Azure云服务器业务板块实施大规模降本。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">Azure旗下软件部门总裁Girish Bablani近期向其约1.15万名下属高管提出要求，需要拿出方案实现至少20%成本削减，目前暂不确定降本是否包含裁员，计划尚未敲定仍存在变数。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>该部门负责云服务器软件开发，不属于Azure数据中心团队；微软整个云业务合计约6万名员工。（新浪财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>特斯拉第二代Roadster发布时间正式定档10月16日</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月14日，特斯拉在社交平台宣布，Roadster活动将于美国15日晚上7:55开启直播。（北京时间16日上午8:55）马斯克转发表示“Timing is everything”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前，特斯拉以恶劣天气预报、活动只能在户外举行为由，将新款Roadster发布活动从10月1日推迟至15日。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据报道，财富管理公司Gerber Kawasaki首席执行官认为，特斯拉可能会限量生产该跑车，且悬浮很可能只是个噱头。他预测，特斯拉很可能在Roadster进行限量尝试，只生产几百辆进行出售。（财联社）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;73fa594e-a24e-42d8-82b0-7395a46e8320&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:259.78333333333336,&quot;width&quot;:286,&quot;currHeight&quot;:259.78333333333336,&quot;currWidth&quot;:286,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:981,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.26481481481481484,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEm7FbEWOEozQaPxUQIGcM3vRnQc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Em7FbEWOEozQaPxUQIGcM3vRnQc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:55889,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295d10cf0.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9083333333333333" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 342px;height: 311px;" data-width="1080" data-height="981" data-imgfileid="504274443" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261015/6ad0295d10cf0.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv8dkkvc1l9t" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>比亚迪披露欧洲建厂计划：法国候选</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>10 月 14 日消息，日前，比亚迪执行副总裁李柯在2026巴黎车展上表示，比亚迪将在欧洲大规模投资制造，比亚迪匈牙利工厂计划在今年第四季度启动大规模生产。同时，比亚迪也将在欧洲建立第二、第三工厂。目前，法国已进入比亚迪欧洲建厂的候选名单。（第一财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>AMD CEO 苏姿丰：今年是真正的“AI 推理之年”</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 14 日消息，日前，AMD CEO 苏姿丰在 2026 年开放计算项目全球峰会发表主题演讲，表态看好 CPU 市场的未来增长前景。苏姿丰预计，2030 年数据中心 AI 加速器市场规模将接近 1.5 万亿美元（约合 10.06 万亿元），CPU 业务的增长空间可能更大。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">苏姿丰还将 2026 年称为“真正的推理之年”，预计 AI 推理今后将占据约 60% 的市场份额。“我们认为，从今年开始，推理将占据约 60% 的市场份额。不仅如此，智能体工作负载更是迎来了爆发式增长。”</p><section style="text-align: justify;">在产品交付方面，苏姿丰透露，AMD 从 9 月开始交付 Helios 量产系统，首批设备部署在 OpenAI、Meta、微软、甲骨文和 Anthropic 等主要客户的数据中心。“第四季度到明年上半年，我们还会继续扩大产量。”（IT之家）</section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
