<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:50:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>茶百道涉IPO欺诈，被暂停交易；字节Seed单独设立大模型安全与对齐部门；华为披露下一代麒麟芯片进展，已进入测试阶段丨雷峰早报</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/zaobao/CKsYHgrcdIkO3hvO.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>要闻提示</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mv6whxd324ws" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section><section data-mpa-action-id="mv6wki971saf" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;">1.茶百道涉IPO欺诈，被暂停交易</section><section style="text-align: justify;">2.字节跳动Seed单独设立大模型安全与对齐部门</section><section style="text-align: justify;">3.华为披露下一代麒麟芯片进展，已进入测试阶段</section><section style="text-align: justify;">4.中国刻蚀机之父尹志尧：AI可能会出现泡沫，国内半导体设备商500家得倒闭90%</section><section style="text-align: justify;">5.DeepSeek融资翻倍至1000亿，新一轮投资方基本确定</section><section style="text-align: justify;">6.传华人AI科学家姚顺宇开启RSI创业，估值高达20亿美金</section><section style="text-align: justify;">7.阿里千问办公电商版曝光：近百人团队开发中，预计双十一预售前夕发布</section><p style="text-align: justify;">8.马斯克谈中国制造：一旦掌握，扩产能力往往能超越全球总和</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>今日头条</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mmxst4fs1xis" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv7ck2rx190i" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>茶百道涉IPO欺诈，被暂停交易</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日，香港证监会发文称，茶百道的首次公开招股可能被人为操纵，意图就茶百道的股份需求营造非真实的表象。因此，香港证监会指示联交所，自当日上午9时起暂停茶百道交易。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">同时，香港证监会还披露，由于两个可疑团伙涉嫌参与IPO欺诈，就首次公开招股的股份需求营造虚假或非真实的表象，香港证监会已对其采取相关措施。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">其中一个可疑团伙参与了茶百道IPO欺诈，香港证监会已向六家经纪行发出限制通知书，禁止它们处置或处理客户账户内最高达43.79亿港元的资产。该金额为历年来同类案件最高限制金额，由孙然及八家相关公司持有。据悉，该团伙还涉嫌参与拨康视云IPO欺诈。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">香港证监会表示，可疑团伙涉嫌参与IPO欺诈，上市公司部分IPO募资款项可能已根据上市公司与上述团伙之间未披露的协议，被转出上市公司，用作投资金融产品。借助此类协议，IPO募资款可能被秘密回流至IPO主要配售对象或关联方。由于调查仍在进行中，香港证监会不会作进一步评论。对于上述情况，茶百道方面暂无回应。（上海证券报）</section><section style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced388b1526.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.725" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="435" data-backw="578" data-backh="419" data-imgfileid="504274396" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced388b1526.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6wimbf1t82" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国内资讯</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>字节跳动Seed单独设立大模型安全与对齐部门</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，字节跳动&nbsp;Seed&nbsp;近日发出内部邮件，宣布将成立&nbsp;&quot;Seed Model-Alignment&amp;Preparedness&quot;&nbsp;部门，由严林负责，汇报给&nbsp;Seed&nbsp;负责人吴永辉。原&nbsp;Responsible AI&nbsp;团队及部分&nbsp;Chat&nbsp;团队成员将转入新部门。<br/>&nbsp;<br/>据悉，该部门的设立旨在加强安全与对齐方向的投入，对齐的核心是让模型的行为与人类意图和安全约束保持一致，从而提升&nbsp;Agent Model（智能体模型）安全能力，以及防范&nbsp;CBRN（化学、生物、放射、核）等前沿能力风险。<br/>&nbsp;<br/><p>此前，国内大模型研究团队的安全与对齐工作大多被纳入到公司整体的安全合规体系中，字节跳动&nbsp;Seed&nbsp;则是国内首家单独成立安全与对齐部门的前沿&nbsp;AI&nbsp;实验室。</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam1od114ht" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-pm-slice="4 3 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;,&quot;data-mpa-action-id&quot;:&quot;mmxst4fs1xis&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-template&quot;:&quot;t&quot;,&quot;mpa-from-tpl&quot;:&quot;t&quot;,&quot;data-mpa-action-id&quot;:&quot;mbam1od114ht&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>华为披露下一代麒麟芯片进展，已进入测试阶段</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p>10月13日消息，在2026华为终端创新技术沟通会上，华为详细介绍了近期随华为三折叠手机Mate XT 2及直板旗舰Mate90 Pro Max面世的麒麟9050系列芯片。</p><p>据华为半导体业务无线终端芯片产品管理部部长徐松余介绍，2023年以来，基于麒麟芯片的终端产品累计发货已经过亿。在中国电子产业的托举下，麒麟9050系列已经成功量产。</p><p>徐松余透露，下一代麒麟2027芯片也已经就绪，到目前为止，所有的测试结果都符合预期，因此在未来10年（逻辑折叠）的演进可持续的。至于具体到哪个阶段，每个点需要用什么样的技术，可能需要逐步在开展和讨论。（上证报、财联社）</p></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>中国刻蚀机之父尹志尧：AI可能会出现泡沫，国内半导体设备商500家得倒闭90%</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，近日，在一活动中，中微公司董事长兼总经理尹志尧对当前AI投资热潮发出警示。中国刻蚀机之父尹志尧表示，现在AI话题非常火热，几乎所有会议都在谈AI，但AI有可能会出现泡沫，这点需要多加留意。</section><section style="text-align: justify;">尹志尧称，回看 1984—2026 年全球半导体行业 CAPEX 的年度增减曲线，波动十分剧烈，行业资本开支一年增幅可以达到 100%，也可以一年下滑 30%，还会出现连续下行。未来我们仍可能经历行业周期性变化，要思考的是如何去应对这种周期波动。</section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>谈及行业格局，尹志尧判断行业整合是必然趋势。与美国经过多轮整合后本土仅剩几十家相比，国内半导体设备企业数量庞大，保守估计最少500家，最多接近1000家。若参照这一格局，国内设备商最终能存活下来的可能也只剩几十家，这意味着90%的厂商将被淘汰出局。他认为国内头部企业需要从单一产品向平台化公司转型，同时具备刻蚀、薄膜和量检测能力，才能为客户提供完整全套解决方案。（快科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>DeepSeek融资翻倍至1000亿，新一轮投资方基本确定</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 13 日消息，有媒体报道称，DeepSeek将在近期完成第二轮融资，拟融资金额从此前计划的500亿元增至约1000亿元，不到半个月翻了一倍。其中，新老股东的拟投资金额约各占一半，投前估值仍为约5000亿元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据相关信息披露，本轮新进投资方包括石溪资本、中芯聚源、CPE源峰、君联资本、吉利等，以产业投资方为主。首轮入局的宁德时代、腾讯、IDG资本、砺思资本和拾象资本，也在本轮交易名单中。其中，宁德时代拟追加约100亿元，其首轮出资金额约为50亿元。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>针对上述报道，一家参与到DeepSeek投资的基金LP人士向媒体表示，情况基本符合事实，“但目前本轮融资交易都还在动态变化当中。”对此，DeepSeek官方暂无回应。（财经杂志）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>传华人AI科学家姚顺宇开启RSI创业，估值高达20亿美金</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>10月13日消息，有市场消息称，Google DeepMind Senior Staff Research Scientist 姚顺宇已开启RSI创业。新公司定位为企业开发定制化模型，估值约20亿美金，主要投资方来自海外。（Top华人科创社）</p><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>阿里千问办公电商版曝光：近百人团队开发中，预计双十一预售前夕发布</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 13 日消息，据媒体报道，阿里旗下 AI 办公产品“千问办公”正在开发一个面向多平台商家的电商版本，计划于双十一预售前夕发布。该项目于今年 6 月开始筹备，9 月进入集中开发阶段，由千问办公 CEO 陈宇森统筹，黄丕培（花名灵培）负责，目前参与员工接近百人。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">消息人士称，阿里电商团队提供行业技能和商家洞察，千问办公团队提供通用 Agent 能力并负责产品协同。千问办公电商版并非独立 App，用户从网页端或客户端进入后，可从通用版本切换至“电商经营”版本。它是一个拥有独立界面和产品逻辑的 Agent，也是千问办公测试的第一个行业版本。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>电商版首页目前设有双十一专区、经营分析、商品管理、素材生产和营销推广 5 个板块，当前形态更接近跨平台的分析和生产工作台，尚不能直接替商家调整投流计划或花钱投放，也不是可以接管店铺的全自动 Agent。（晚点 LatePost）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>字节跳动开启新一轮期权回购：每股 241.35 美元，离职员工不打折</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 13 日，据媒体报道，字节跳动发布全员信，宣布启动 2026 年 10 月期权回购。本次回购价格为税前每股 241.35 美元（约合 1,618 元人民币），与 9 月初流传价格一致。参与此次回购的人员包含离职员工，其中近期因业务调整离开的员工，每股回购价格与在职员工相同。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据全员信披露，回购额度按不同授予类型计算：总包类期权每批次归属后可申请回购该批次已归属股数的 50%，之后每满一年增加 10%；绩效类期权中，2026 年 1 月 1 日前授予的每批次归属后可申请回购 100%，2026 年 1 月 1 日及之后授予的可回购 55%，之后每满一年增加 15%；奖金类期权首个归属日后满一年可申请回购 50%，满两年可申请 100%。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>全员信同时显示，入职授予的总包类期权需约 5 年完成 100% 归属，绩效优秀授予的期权约 3 至 4 年可完成 100% 归属。字节方面表示，此次回购旨在满足部分同学的现金需求，提供额外流动性，员工可结合自身实际需求自愿参加。（大厂日爆）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>华为哈勃投资参投，视塔机器人完成天使轮融资</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 13 日消息，据媒体报道，深圳视塔机器人科技有限公司完成天使轮融资，投资方包括华为旗下哈勃投资、深高新投旗下基金及高轩投资等，多维资本担任独家财务顾问。本轮融资将用于产品研发迭代与商业化，拓展具身智能、消费电子和工业等多场景应用。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>视塔以柔性光子晶体材料为技术起点，聚焦触觉感知与机器人操作。核心研发团队来自南方科技大学智能液晶光学实验室，创始人兼 CEO 张伟博士阶段由南方科技大学与香港城市大学联合培养。该公司已围绕光子晶体触觉技术延伸出触觉传感器、数据采集系统与触觉控制模型等产品和技术方向。（投中网）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>字节赛豆合作品牌第二款车型预计为SUV，考虑采用换电方案</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，由赛力斯、宁德时代等持股，并与字节跳动旗下火山引擎深度合作的赛豆科技，正持续推进新品规划。据悉，赛豆科技AIVA品牌的第二款车型预计为SUV，将考虑采用换电方案。至于是否与宁德时代巧克力换电合作，该知情人士称，最终换电合作方案暂未确定，“还没定义清楚。”</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据了解，“巧克力换电”整体解决方案由宁德时代全资子公司时代电服科技有限公司推出。官方信息显示，截至今年9月29日，“巧克力换电”全国累计建成换电站超2520座，站点落地覆盖31省200城，近2万块宁德全新电池完成入仓部署。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>而赛豆科技则由国资、赛力斯、宁德时代及多方产业资本共同参与，其前身为重庆蓝电科技有限公司，于今年5月底正式更名。（蓝鲸新闻）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>比亚迪大汉正式上市：纯电续航1008公里，售价23.59万-27.59万元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日晚间消息，比亚迪王朝闪充豪华旗舰轿车大汉正式上市。此次大汉共推出1008KM后驱激光雷达尊享型、1008KM后驱激光雷达旗舰型、880KM四驱激光雷达旗舰型三款车型，售价区间23.59万-27.59万元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">大汉车长超5米2，轴距超3米1。技术层面，大汉搭载全新升级的第二代刀片电池，实现D级纯电轿车最长续航里程——1008公里，拥有0.197超低风阻；大汉标配闪充。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">智能化领域，大汉标配天神之眼 B - 辅助驾驶激光版，高快领航辅助、城市领航辅助、全场景智能泊车齐备，并标配比亚迪AI超级智能体“迪迪虾”。（新浪科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3732bc1d-4d9f-4e58-84b4-5be7c8af204a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:300,&quot;width&quot;:550,&quot;currHeight&quot;:300,&quot;currWidth&quot;:550,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:300,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:550,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FOa95bcgpVoClEFxqlGUc2TlgnXc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Oa95bcgpVoClEFxqlGUc2TlgnXc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:26153,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced388f2aff.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5454545454545454" data-type="jpeg" data-w="550" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="550" data-height="300" data-backw="550" data-backh="300" data-imgfileid="504274395" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced388f2aff.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6ws54l24yx" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>智元启动新一轮融资，估值500亿元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，据媒体报道，投资人称，具身智能独角兽公司智元创新近期启动了新一轮融资，融资额约10亿元-15亿元，本轮融资已接近收尾，最新估值约500亿元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据悉，2026年7月，智元宣布启动港股上市筹备工作，当时有投资人称，智元预计最快于8月挂牌，目标估值400亿-500亿港元。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>根据港交所的相关要求，上市申请公司如果在递表后、上市前完成新融资，除非获得特殊豁免，上市申请公司需要等到融资完成后满120日，才可挂牌交易。前述投资人称，新一轮融资意味着智元在今年内无法完成IPO。（财经杂志）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>BBA和特斯拉全被干翻！小米SU7拿下20万元以上轿车销量第一</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，小米汽车官方宣布，2026年9月，小米SU7位列20万以上轿车销量第一。据悉，小米SU7自2026年6月首次登顶20万以上轿车市场销量第一后，已连续多月稳坐该细分市场头把交椅。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前，20万以上轿车市场长期由BBA燃油车型和特斯拉Model 3主导。奔驰E级、宝马5系、奥迪A6L三款传统豪华中大型轿车此前长期占据该价格带销量前三。2026年7月SU7月销21044辆，直接将特斯拉Model 3（约1.2万辆）和奔驰E级甩在身后。从2024年发布到2025年末的21个月中，SU7有13个月单月销量超过特斯拉Model 3。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前报道，小米SU7是小米汽车旗下首款纯电中大型轿车，2024年3月正式发布，2026款于2026年初上市，售价区间21.99万至30.39万元。（快科技）</p><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6wsmiykb" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>阿里千问将推出Personal Agent千问Go</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>10月13日，媒体了解到，千问Personal Agent“千问Go！”即将发布。据悉，千问Go基于千问app服务，可帮助用户完成订单理赔、汽车保养、运动预约和购物比价等任务。加速打造Personal Agent后，千问拓展了个人助理的办事范围和能力，需要时，千问可自主查询操作各类授权平台，比较方案、电话联系服务方，完成目标任务。（第一财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>MiniMax开设天猫官方旗舰店，token套餐首单5折</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日，大模型厂商MiniMax入驻天猫，开设其首家品牌官方旗舰店。目前，店铺已经上架M Plan订阅套餐，包括Go、Explore、Build三档套餐，支持按月、按年购买。活动界面显示，即日起至10月14日，用户有首单5折的限时优惠。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>此前，智谱、阿里云、千问办公等均已在天猫开店，天猫还上线了Token充值中心“AI空间站”，将多家大模型订阅服务集中到同一入口。（第一财经）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>王腾创业公司AI健康科学团队亮相：超半数员工来自华为、小米等大厂</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，王腾创办的ISHO今日宜休正式公布AI健康科学团队，汇聚AI算法、临床医学、睡眠科学等领域的专业人才。王腾透露，公司团队规模近日正式突破100人，成为创业以来的又一个重要里程碑。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据介绍，今日宜休AI健康科学团队汇聚了多位专业人才，不少成员拥有十余年睡眠领域研究经验，在睡眠监测、状态识别、数据算法等方面具备丰富的技术积累。值得一提的是，王腾表示，团队超过半数员工来自华为、小米等科技大厂。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">据了解，今年1月，王腾正式宣布创办今日宜休，聚焦睡眠健康领域，希望通过科技手段改善用户睡眠质量，帮助用户获得更好的精力状态。融资方面，今年5月，CMC资本宣布完成对今日宜休的新一轮投资，参与本轮融资的机构包括CMC资本、云九资本、君礼资本、弘晖基金、高瓴创投等。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;641ad85d-6a65-4976-b567-264294fcdcb7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:350.32,&quot;width&quot;:348,&quot;currHeight&quot;:350.32,&quot;currWidth&quot;:348,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:604,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.58,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCbfZbUBPfoYasVxWdOUcQ4lwn4e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CbfZbUBPfoYasVxWdOUcQ4lwn4e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:285593,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced38939090.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0066666666666666" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="604" data-backw="578" data-backh="582" data-imgfileid="504274394" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced38939090.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam15q08cj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国际资讯</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>马斯克谈中国制造：一旦掌握，扩产能力往往能超越全球总和</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 13 日消息，埃隆 · 马斯克在社交平台表示，一旦中国掌握某种产品的制造方法后，他们的扩产能力往往能超过世界其他地区之总和。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据了解，此番讨论建立在人工智能分析师 Melvin 的长篇文章之上。这名分析师认为，长鑫存储正成为美光、三星、SK 海力士的竞争对手。数据显示，长鑫存储目前在全球 DRAM 市场营收份额约为 9.5%，高于上一季度的 7.6%，已成为全球第四大 DRAM 制造商。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">不过这名分析师认为，市场对长鑫 4F² DRAM 技术的突破有点反应过度，这家公司仍然需要证明自己能实现有竞争力的良率、定价、可靠性和产量。且该技术主要针对传统 DDR5 服务器内存，而非 HBM。</section><section style="text-align: justify;">马斯克则回复道，当中国掌握某种产品的制造方法后，他们的扩产能力往往能超过世界其他地区之总和，锂电池和太阳能产业就是鲜活的例子。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;237348e4-b50d-48f1-a9ac-4a7a55753971&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:420,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;currHeight&quot;:420,&quot;currWidth&quot;:600,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:420,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FV8ZtbLJjpoIq5Tx6DiBcz84rnZe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;V8ZtbLJjpoIq5Tx6DiBcz84rnZe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:196411,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced38992a0a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="420" data-backw="578" data-backh="405" data-imgfileid="504274399" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced38992a0a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6ww1qpgjw" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>国产旗舰出海封神！极氪9X海外售价曝光：瑞士卖到近百万元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，据博主@电车出海 整理了极氪9X在各国市场的售价数据，欧洲核心市场均价普遍突破90万元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">例如，瑞士市场均价最高，达到约95.3万元，对比国内均价53.3万元涨幅为78.9%。荷兰与德国均为94.2万元，涨幅76.7%；意大利93.9万元，涨幅76.2%；比利时92.6万元，涨幅73.8%......阿联酋作为中东首站，均价74.1万元，涨幅39.1%，是海外市场中价格最接近国内的地区。欧洲市场整体高出国内65%至79%。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">极氪9X于2025年9月29日在国内上市，国内市场指导价区间为46.59万至58.59万元，五座版于2026年7月28日上市，权益后限时售价45.19万元起。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4e37080e-e8ae-4b51-a5f5-339e235379ae&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:707.16,&quot;width&quot;:426,&quot;currHeight&quot;:707.16,&quot;currWidth&quot;:426,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:996,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.71,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMJjHbXiWUoAyN2xTEM1cR9xanJh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;MJjHbXiWUoAyN2xTEM1cR9xanJh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:397683,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced389d1e58.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.66" data-type="png" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="996" data-backw="578" data-backh="959" data-imgfileid="504274398" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261014/6aced389d1e58.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mv6wy1mg1qhd" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>颠覆芯片研发节奏！马斯克Terafab计划：年产测试10款芯片</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，马斯克透露了对Terafab芯片工厂的规划图景，称特斯拉和SpaceX的目标是在Terafab位于美国得克萨斯州Giga Texas的研究工厂，每年制造和测试约10种芯片设计，以加快开发过程。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">马斯克强调，特斯拉和SpaceX在芯片制造领域展开合作，并希望尝试一些高风险、高回报的探索。但每年推出10款设计的目标，是为了加快芯片的制造和测试周期，而非每年将10种不同设计投入量产。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">科技分析师Akash Gupta指出，在芯片两年的研发周期中，大部分时间并非用于设计，而是用于验证。在尖端制程节点上，光掩模成本高达数千万美元，而晶圆需经过1000多个工艺步骤才能出厂，这也需要三到四个月时间。他强调，这一流程意味着大多数团队平均每季度才能完成一次真正的学习周期，且每一次验证都可能需要数百万美元。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>Gupta总结认为，在马斯克这一设想下，Terafab工厂的犯错成本极低，就像SpaceX研究火箭，其发动机成本非常低廉，因此爆炸也无所谓。一旦这一循环成立，对芯片业内的竞争对手来说将非常可怕，因为Terafab的测试速度和成本都将大幅领先。（快科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>OpenAI计划复活Sora</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，据外媒报道，OpenAI 正在与一家初创公司谈判，计划将其搁置的视频生成人工智能 Sora 移交给该公司。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">报道称，一家为电影制作人开发人工智能视频技术的初创公司正在与OpenAI洽谈使用Sora平台。这家初创公司计划接管Sora平台，对其进行改进，并基于此销售软件或服务。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">这家正在与 OpenAI 洽谈的初创公司由好莱坞重量级人物杰弗里·卡岑伯格、领导 Sora 研究的比尔·皮布尔斯以及 Dropbox 前首席财务官苏杰·贾斯瓦于数月前创立，目前名称不详。目前尚不清楚这家初创公司是否也会收到 Sora 权重，即决定模型如何回答问题的参数值。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>此前报道，今年早些时候，OpenAI 因业务调整而停止了 Sora 模型和一款基于音频的应用程序的开发。（三言科技）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>Anthropic投入1亿美元培训AI工程师，计划2027年底培养1万人</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，据外媒报道，随着AI在企业内部加速普及，一类被称为FDE的工程师正在成为硅谷的新热门岗位。Anthropic准备投入1亿美元，专门培养这类能够帮助企业真正部署和使用AI的人才。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">Anthropic本月早些时候宣布启动一项新的FDE培训计划。目前，来自其他公司的工程师已经开始报名。按照计划，入选者将先参加为期4天的现场强化培训，随后回到各自公司，在接下来的12周内使用Claude工具开展实际项目，并继续接受Anthropic团队的指导。Anthropic希望到2027年底，通过这一计划培训1万名工程师。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>在Anthropic准备进行大规模IPO的背景下，这项计划显然也承担着商业任务：让更多企业真正学会使用AI，并进一步增加Claude在企业市场的使用量。过去两年，FDE相关招聘需求快速增长。越来越多企业开始采购AI软件，但买到模型并不意味着就能把AI真正部署进业务流程，因此需要既懂技术又懂实际业务的工程师帮助落地。（鞭牛士）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>特斯拉核心供应商确认：Optimus方案接近定型，即将进入量产周期</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月13日消息，据报道，近日，特斯拉机器人核心供应商新剑传动发布创业板上市审核问询函回复，明确表示特斯拉机器人设计方案接近定型，即将进入量产周期。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">新剑传动在回复文件中梳理称，目前特斯拉已公开的专利主要涉及执行器、膝关节、灵巧手、电池、散热、充电等方面，Optimus的硬件设计方案逐渐明晰。公司判断，Optimus V3的硬件设计方案已基本冻结定型，人形机器人直线关节执行器尤其是重载场景主要以行星滚柱丝杠作为核心传动部件，行业在一定时期内不会出现其他实际可用的替代方案。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">量产节奏方面，Optimus V3的设计已经可以展示，计划在2026年底前开启量产。特斯拉已将美国弗里蒙特工厂的原Model S和Model X产线改造为Optimus V3产线，长期产能目标100万台/年，目前改造正在进行。特斯拉还准备建设德州超级工厂，计划2027年开工，建成后用于量产Optimus，长期产能目标高达1000万台/年。目前已有少量Optimus在弗里蒙特工厂内部运行，主要用于AI训练和数据采集。（快科技）</section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
